<%# One chart card on homepage B (#909): a question as its title, a one-line subtitle, the chart, then the source line
    and the link text at the bottom. The whole card is one link. Locals:
    key: the chart (for the analytics), size: :large or :small, url:, title:, subtitle:, sources: the source line (or
    nil), link: the link text. The block is the chart. %>
<%= link_to url, class: "nd-chart nd-chart--#{size}", data: { home_chart: key } do %>
  <h2 class="nd-chart__title type-title-md"><%= title %></h2>
  <p class="nd-chart__sub type-small"><%= subtitle %></p>
  <div class="nd-chart__body"><%= yield %></div>
  <div class="nd-chart__foot">
    <% if sources %><span class="nd-chart__src type-data-sm"><%= sources %></span><% end %>
    <span class="nd-chart__more type-ui"><%= link %> →</span>
  </div>
<% end %>
